000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TDELTPO.
000500 AUTHOR.        KUT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).

000800***************************************************************
000900**                                                           **
001000**   TDELTPO.UTIL   - UTILITY PROGRAM FOR CALLING THE        **
001100**                    SUBROUTINE 'SDELTPO' WHICH DELETES     **
001200**                    A PURCHASE ORDER.                      **
001300**                                                           **
001400***************************************************************
      *
      *C  07/22/96   CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  11/10/97   CA YODER
      *C    ADDED SCREEN INTERFACE SO THAT USERS COULD MOVE POS TO
      *C    HISTORY.  IF THIS PROGRAM IS CALLED FROM MCXTDELTPN, THE
      *C    USER CANNOT USE THE DELETE CAPABILITY.  IF THIS PROGRAM
      *C    IS CALLED FROM MCXTDELTPY, THE USER CAN JUST DELETE THE
      *C    PO WITHOUT MOVING TO HISTORY.
      *C
      *C  02/04/98   CA YODER
      *C    ADDED CHECKS TO MAKE SURE THE PO PASSES SEVERAL EDITS
      *C    BEFORE MOVING THE PO TO HISTORY.  IF THIS PROGRAM IS
      *C    CALLED FROM MCXTDELTPY, THE EDIT CHECKS ARE SKIPPED.
      *C
      *C 09DEC1999  DAVE PLUM
      *C   REPLACED THE "STOP RUN" STATEMENT WITH A "GOBACK"
      *C   STATEMENT.
      *C
DCR01 *C   NOV 21, 2003   D.RAUCH  DCR01
DCR01 *C   ADDED CODE TO PROCESS REMOVAL OF PO LOGGING TRIGGER REC
      *C
      *C   JAN 08, 2004   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PASS PARAMETER TO SDELTPO THAT THE ITEM
      *C   IS BEING MOVED TO HISTORY.
      *C
      ****************************************************************


001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001900 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002000 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.   I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                        LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDELTPO-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPOITEM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPORCV-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVRCD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2502
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

