009600 1-HSK.
009700
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, DPORECD-I, DPOITEM-I, DINVRCD-I.
           OPEN I-O MPORCV-O, DISPLAY-FILE.

      **********************************************
      *  DOES PLANT USE INVOICING?
      **********************************************

           MOVE "PODL"       TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "GET MPLTINFO 'PODL' *1-HSK" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-INVOICE-IND  TO  INVOICE-INDIC-SW.
011600
011700******************************************
011800*   GET CO. CODE FROM MPLTINFO
011900******************************************
012000
012100     MOVE "P 01"       TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
012500         MOVE "GET MPLTINFO 'P 01' *1-HSK" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
012600         GO TO 2-BLOWUP
012700     ELSE
012800         MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY  TO  COMPANY-SAVE.

      *------- SEE IF USER IS AUTHORIZED TO DELETE POS FROM THIS
      *------- PROGRAM.
      *------- IF TDELTPO JCW = "0", THE USER CANNOT DELETE POS.
           ACCEPT MC-LOCAL-DATA-AREA FROM LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
           IF JCW-TDELTPO-307 = "0"
               MOVE "N"  TO DELETE-CAPABILITY-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "Y"  TO DELETE-CAPABILITY-SW.

DCR01 *===============================================================
DCR01      PERFORM Z001-SETUP-PO-LOGGING    THRU Z001-EXIT.
DCR01 *===============================================================


013000 1-H-X.
013100     EXIT.
013200
013300
013400 2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DPORECD-I, MPORCV-O, MPLTINFO-I, DISPLAY-FILE,
                 DPOITEM-I, DINVRCD-I.
014500
014600 2-EOJ-X.
014700     EXIT.
