015500
015600 2-BLOWUP.
015700     MOVE "TDELTPO"  TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
015800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
015900         VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
016000             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
016100
016200
016300
